{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OVC0pEWJvY1794364020.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>旺角有唐樓單位起火，5人不適，部分人要送院。</p><p></p><p>事發後消防和救護員趕到現場，多名住客疏散到街外暫避。有女童受驚，家人帶同寵物貓逃生。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0900_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jAHWCWJ6S51794361688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方早上7時許接報，新填地街316號一個唐樓單位冒煙，消防出動一隊煙帽隊，開動一條喉灌救，約半小時將火救熄。消防初步調查相信，單位內有充電器起火。至少一名住客受傷，清醒送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wa2JWH7MnU1794361685.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>三樓住戶夏小朋友說：「起床時，有人不斷拍門，我很害怕。然後突然間有消防員衝進來，又出了去。我就跟姐姐說，姐姐立刻叫我走，然後就叫我和哥哥走。很害怕，很害怕又要搬屋。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:51:00.147879+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:12.459797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T02:44:22.036228+00:00","content_hash":"68b8443b8e1098188b973a7c51b4457eac37fc21faa5117d2f2757d29a144b80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T02:51:00.147879+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}